/* Hea008: B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS named 'non_uniform_metric' with 4x4 control grid: left side (U=0) clustered in x=[0,1] (control points 'cluster_lo_a'...'cluster_lo_d'), right side (U=1) spread to x=[20,20] -- surface metric varies ~10x along U; edge spans full U range with uniform UV pcurve (U=0..1, V=0.5); affine remapping gives wrong 3D samples; projection-based transfer required; wrapped in GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET; OCC silently accepts; spec-kernel must heal/reject */
